---
args: {"hearing": "ExceptionHearing", "prior": "WaiverRegister"}
returns: "{ caseKey:string; requestIds:string[]; factChanges:string[] }[]"
---
Use beneficiary, underlying event, requested deviation and explicit identifiers to link a resubmission to the same case. Changed wording alone neither establishes a new case nor proves unchanged facts. Compare newly supplied observations with prior facts; preserve material differences and their source editions. Keep ambiguous identity unresolved instead of inheriting a convenient rejection or grant. Return aliases and actual fact deltas for the continuing argument history.
